#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:151
msgid "&Verify"
msgstr "Pro&vjeri"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:152
msgid ""
"<qt>Click this button to quickly determine whether or not the environment "
"variable names you supplied are valid. If an environment variable is not "
"found, the associated labels will be <b>highlighted</b> to indicate the "
"invalid settings.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste na brzinu provjerili jesu li varijable "
"okruženja koje ste napisali ispravne. Ako neka varijabla okruženja nije "
"pronađena, njena oznaka će biti <b>istaknuta</b> da bi vam se ukazalo na "
"grešku.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:161
msgid "Auto &Detect"
msgstr "&Automatsko nalaženje"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to attempt automatic discovery of the environment "
"variables used for setting system wide proxy information."
"<p> This automatic lookup works by searching for the following common "
"variable names:</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTP: </u>%1</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTPS: </u>%2</p><p><u>For FTP: </u>%3</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Pritiskom na ovo dugme ćete pokušati automatsko nalaženje varijabli "
"okruženja koje sadrže sistemske proxy podatke."
"<p> Ovaj automatski postupak radi tako što traži vrijednosti sljedećih "
"varijabli: </p>"
"<p><u>Za HTTP:</u>%1/p>"
"<p><u>Za HTTPS: </u>%2</p><p><u>Za FTP: </u>%3</p></qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:178 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:411
msgid "Show &Values"
msgstr "Pokaži &vrijednosti"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:184
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to see the actual values associated with the "
"environment variables.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste vidjeli trenutne vrijednosti pridružene "
"okolinskim varijablama.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:301 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:481
msgid "You must specify at least one valid proxy environment variable."
msgstr "Morate navesti barem jednu ispravnu okolinsku proxy varijablu."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:304 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:484
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure you entered the actual environment variable name rather than "
"its value. For example, if the environment variable is "
