#: kproxydlg.cpp:386
msgid ""
"<h1>Proxy</h1>"
"<p>This module lets you configure your proxy settings.</p>"
"<p>"
"A proxy is a program on another computer that receives requests from your "
"machine to access a certain web page (or other Internet resources), "
"retrieves the page and sends it back to you.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Proxy</h1>"
"<p>Ovaj modul vam omogućava podešavanje vašeg proxy servera.</p>"
"<p>"
"Proxy je program na drugom računaru koji prima zahtjeve sa vaše mašine za "
"određenu web stranicu, dobavlja je, a zatim je prosljeđuje nazad vama.</p>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:40
msgid ""
